      "content": "idk, i dont know if \"just breathing\" is enough. it feels more like just prolonging the inevitable. if the outcome is already decided and things are just gonna get worse and worse, why is there any moral requirement to endure it? it feels less like \"surviving\" and more like just being a witness to a slow-motion disaster.",
